                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Outskirt is a simple but deep shoot'em up. It is a mix between between Ikaruga and Super Hexagon : move in a circle, shoot in the center, absord the bullets of your color, shoot the ennemies of other colors and switch from color to color while trying to increase your multiplicator. That is the theory, but in reality, you are going to loose while the relaxing music is taunting you, you are going to tilt, but you are going to keep playing :/. Gotta get those sweet points.",
